<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no,address=no,email=no,date=no,url=no"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light"/><style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Arial';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      mso-font-alt: 'sans-serif';

    }

    * {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    }
  </style><style>blockquote,h1,h2,h3,img,li,ol,p,ul{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}@media only screen and (max-width:425px){.tab-row-full{width:100%!important}.tab-col-full{display:block!important;width:100%!important}.tab-pad{padding:0!important}}</style></head><body style="background-color:#f3f3f0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="margin:0px;background-color:#f3f3f0;padding-top:32px;padding-right:12px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:12px"><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">Your Pro plan ended and your files are over the Free limit. Nothing has been deleted.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:560px;width:100%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border-style:solid;background-color:#ffffff;min-width:300px;padding-top:28px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:28px;border-radius:14px;border-width:1px;border-color:#e3e3de"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><h3 style="margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#222222;font-size:24px;line-height:38px;font-weight:600">Your files are over the Free storage limit</h3><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">Your Pro plan has ended, and your files use more than the <!-- -->{{.StorageLimit}}<!-- --> the Free plan includes. Nothing has been deleted.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="border-color:#f0e0bd;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;background-color:#fdf5e4;border-radius:10px;padding-top:14px;padding-right:16px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:16px"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 0px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0">Storage used: <strong>{{.StorageUsed}}</strong><br/>Free plan limit: <strong>{{.StorageLimit}}</strong><br/>Free up space by: <strong>{{.GraceEndsAt}}</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">Until then you can read, download, organize and delete your files, but uploads and edits are paused in the workspaces you pay for. If you&#x27;re still over the limit on <!-- -->{{.GraceEndsAt}}<!-- -->, your account becomes read-only.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><a href="{{.OpenURL}}" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#222222;border-color:#222222;border-width:2px;border-style:solid;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 20px 12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Manage subscription</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">Prefer to stay on Free? Delete files you no longer need until you&#x27;re under <!-- -->{{.StorageLimit}}<!-- -->.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:32px"/><p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px;color:#6e6e68;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale">You got this email because your Capy Notebook Pro plan ended.</p><p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px;color:#6e6e68;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale"><a href="{{.UnsubscribeURL}}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#5a4bc2;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Stop billing emails</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>
